desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "javascript"
	title: "检测 React dangerouslySetInnerHTML"
	title_zh: "检测 React dangerouslySetInnerHTML"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "source-js-dangerously-set-innerhtml"
	risk: "xss"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 dangerouslySetInnerHTML。外部 HTML 可导致 XSS。

### 风险类型
xss

### 影响
该用法属于已知危险 API 或弱密码学配置，可能被用于绕过校验、执行代码或泄露机密。

### 检测方式
源码模式正则匹配，定位源码中的危险调用或配置。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
使用文本节点或经过消毒的 HTML。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://a.js": <<<POS
function V(html) { return { dangerouslySetInnerHTML: { __html: html } }; }

POS
	"safefile://s.js": <<<NEG
function V(t) { return { children: t }; }

NEG
)

${*.js}.pattern_regex(/dangerouslySetInnerHTML/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "high",
	title: "检测 React dangerouslySetInnerHTML",
	title_zh: "检测 React dangerouslySetInnerHTML",
	message: "检测 React dangerouslySetInnerHTML",
	risk: "xss",
}
